#. Tag: title
#: dcop.docbook:5 dcop.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "&DCOP; Functions"
msgstr "&DCOP; Funkcije"

#. Tag: author
#: dcop.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "<firstname></firstname> <surname></surname>"
msgstr "<firstname></firstname><surname></surname>"

#. Tag: trans_comment
#: dcop.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROLES_OF_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "ULOGE PREVODIOCA"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&DCOP; can be called in several ways in &kommander;. First is the console "
"method"
msgstr ""
"&DCOP; može biti pozvan na više načina u &kommander; - u. Prvi je konzolni "
"metod."

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"dcop kmdr-executor-@pid KommanderIf changeWidgetText myWidget <quote>new "
"text</quote>"
msgstr ""
"dcop kmdr-executor-@pid KommanderIf changeWidgetText myWidget <quote>novi "
"tekst</quote>"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This assumes you are inside a &kommander; file and have access to the "
"special @pid which contains the process ID. In fact it is simpler to replace "
"<quote>kmdr-executor-@pid</quote> with @dcopid. However, you can use this "
"syntax (obviously without the specials) from the command line or any "
"external script to alter the &kommander; window."
msgstr ""
"Ovo pretpostavlja da ste unutar &kommander; datoteke i imate pristup "
"specijalnom @pid koji sadrži ID procesa. Ustvari je jednostavnije zamijeniti "
"<quote> kmdr-executor-@pid </quote> sa @dcopid. U svakom slučaju, možete "
"koristiti ovu sintaksu (naravno bez specijalnih znakova) sa komandne linije "
"ili bilo koje vanjske skripte da izmijenite &kommander; prozor."

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Because &kommander; does not have a full parser in it's Alpha stage, if you "
"want to use the much faster internal &DCOP; from another application window "
"(console &DCOP; is very slow) it is more complicated because you must give "
"lots of information, including a prototype of the call. The above call would "
"become:"
msgstr ""
"Budući da &kommander; ne posjeduje puni parser u svom Alfa izdanju, ako "
"želite da koristite dosta brži interni &DCOP; od drugog prozora aplikacije "
"(konzola &DCOP; je veoma spora) komplikovanije je jer morate dati dosta "
"informacija, uključujući prototip poziva. Gornji poziv bi postao:"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@dcop(@dcopid, KommanderIf, <quote>enableWidget(QString, bool)</quote>, "
"Widget, true)"
msgstr ""
"@dcop(@dcopid, KommanderIf, <quote>enableWidget(QString, bool)</quote>, "
"Widget, true)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the time of this writing you should be aware that nesting &DCOP; calls "
"inside script language structures (like <application>bash</application>) "
"means that you must use console method calls. <emphasis>If you use internal "
"&DCOP; all &kommander; specials will be executed first and then the script "
"will be executed.</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"U vrijeme pisanja ovoga trebate imati na umu da ugnježđivanje &DCOP; poziva "
"unutar struktura skriptovnog jezika (kao <application> bash </application>) "
"znači da morate koristiti konzolne pozive metoda. <emphasis> Ako koristite "
"interni &DCOP; sve &kommander; specijalnosti će biti izvršene prvo i onda će "
"se izvršiti skripta. </emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is a new simplified way to use &DCOP; inside &kommander; using an "
"object syntax. Let's say you want to change the text in a widget name "
"@LineEdit1. It would look like this."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je novi pojednostavljeni način korištenja &DCOP; unutar &kommander;-a "
"koristeći objektnu sintaksu. Recimo da hoćete da promijenite tekst u imenu "
"dodatka @LineEdit1. Izgledalo bi ovako."

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "@LineEdit1.changeWidgetText(New text)"
msgstr "@LineEdit1.changeWidgetText(New text)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As you can see the new syntax is very easy, as well as consistent visually "
"with function groups. All the &DCOP; reference here will use the new object "
"syntax listed above. <emphasis>Please note that if you are referencing a "
"widget using &DCOP; from another window or another application the first "
"parameter will always be the widget name. All functions are listed here "
"starting with the second parameter.</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"Kao što vidite nova sintaksa je veoma jednostavna, kao i vizuelno "
"konzistentna sa funkcionalnim grupama. Sve &DCOP; reference ovdje će "
"koristiti novu objektnu sintaksu navedenu gore. <emphasis> Molimo imajte na "
"umu da ukoliko referencirate dodatak koristeći &DCOP; iz drugog prozora ili "
"druge aplikacije prvi parametar će uvijek biti ime dodatka. Sve funkcije su "
"navede ovdje, polazeći od drugog parametra. </emphasis>"

#. Tag: title
#: dcop.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "&DCOP; for Global Variables"
msgstr "&DCOP; za Globalne Varijable"

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "global(QString variableName)"
msgstr "global(QString variableName)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns the value of the specified global variable. When a script is run "
"from within a &kommander; window any (non-global) variables set in that "
"script will cease to exist after the script completes and therfore will not "
"be available to other script processes or in a new instance of the calling "
"process. The global <quote>scope</quote> means the variable will exist for "
"any process of the window until that window is closed. You may change these "
"variables at any time with a new call to <function>@setGlobal</function>."
msgstr ""
"Vraća vrijednost specificirane globalne varijable. Kada je skripta pokrenuta "
"iz &kommander; prozora svaka (ne-globalna) varijabla postavljena u skripti "
"će prestati postojati nakon što se skripta završi i samim time neće biti "
"dostupna ostalim skriptovnim procesima ili u novoj instanci pozivnog "
"procesa. Globalni <quote> opseg </quote> znači da će varijabla postojati za "
"svaki proces prozora dok se taj prozor ne zatvori. Možete mijenjati ove "
"varijable u bilo kada novim pozivom <function> @setGlobal </function>."

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "setGlobal(QString variableName, QString value)"
msgstr "setGlobal(QString variableName, QString value)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Creates a variable that is global to the window process and assigns the "
"value to it. This value can be retrieved with global(QString variableName) "
"or set again."
msgstr ""
"Kreira varijablu koja je globalna procesu prozora i dodjeljuje joj "
"vrijednost. Ovoj vrijednosti se može pristupiti sa global(Qstring "
"variableName) ili se može ponovo postaviti."

#. Tag: title
#: dcop.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "&DCOP; for all Widgets"
msgstr "&DCOP; za sve grafičke kontrole"

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "changeWidgetText(QString text)"
msgstr "changeWidgetText(QString text)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This should be renamed setWidgetText and this name will probably be "
"deprecated. This removes the text displayed in the widget and replaces it "
"with the text supplied."
msgstr ""
"Ovo bi trebalo biti preimenovano u setWidgetText i ovo ime će vjerovatno "
"biti zamijenjeno. Ovo briše tekst prikazan u dodatku i zamjenjuje ga sa "
"unesenim tekstom."

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "enableWidget(bool enable)"
msgstr "enableWidget(bool enable)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enables or disables a widget."
msgstr "Omogućava ili onemogućava dodatak."

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "associatedText"
msgstr "enableWidget(bool enable)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns the text associated with the specified widget. This is not the same "
"as the displayed text. It would be <quote>@widgetText</quote> or the text "
"and/or scripting used to arrive at the displayed value."
msgstr ""
"Vraća tekst povezan sa specificiranim dodatkom. Ovo nije isto kao prikazani "
"tekst. Bilo bi <quote> @widgetText</quote> ili tekst i/ili skripta korištena "
"da se dođe do prikazane varijable."

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "setAssociatedText(QString text)"
msgstr "setAssociatedText(QString text)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This sets the &kommander; Text default string. This is typically set to "
"<quote>@widgetText</quote> to display what is entered into the widget. It is "
"unlikely you will have much need for this, but if you do it is there. "
"Applies to all widgets that can contain data."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja &komannder; Tekst na unaprijed zadani string. Ovo je obično "
"postavljeno na <quote>@widgetText</quote> da se prikaže šta je uneseno u "
"dodatak. Malo je vjerovatno da ćete imati preveliku potrebu za ovim, ali ako "
"budete tu je. Primjenjivo je na sve dodatke koji sadrže podatke."

#. Tag: title
#: dcop.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "&DCOP; for ListBox and ComboBox Widgets"
msgstr "&DCOP; za ListBox i ComboBox Dodatke"

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "addListItem(QString item, int index)"
msgstr "addListItem(QString item, int index)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adds an item to a ListBox widget at the specified index. List index starts "
"at zero. To add to the end of the list use -1."
msgstr ""
"Dodaje stavku u ListBox dodatak na specificirani inteks. Indeksi liste "
"počinju od nule. Da biste završili listu koristite -1."

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "addListItems(QStringList items, int index)"
msgstr "addListItems(QStringList items, int index)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This adds a list of strings all at once. The list should be delimited by "
"<acronym>EOL</acronym> (\\n - newlines). This is handy as you can use bash "
"to derive the list rather easily. For instance, using @exec(ls -l ~/projects "
"| grep kmdr) for items will give you a directory listing of &kommander; "
"files in your projects folder. List index starts at zero. Use -1 to add to "
"the end of the list."
msgstr ""
"Dodaje listu stringova odjednom. Lista bi trebala biti razgraničena pomoću "
"<acronym>EOL</acronym> (\\n - newlines). Ovo je korisno jer možete koristiti "
"bash da izvedere listu poprilično jednostavno. Naprimjer, koristeći @exec(ls "
"-l ~/projects | grep kmdr) za stavke će vam dati listu direktorija "
"&kommander; datoteka u vašem projekt folderu. Indeksi liste počinju od 0. "
"Koristite -1 da završite listu."

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "addUniqueItem(QString item)"
msgstr "addUniqueItem(QString item)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"addUniqueItem will add an item to the end of the list only if it is unique."
msgstr ""
"addUniqueItem će dodati stavku na kraj liste samo ako je ona jedinstvena."

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "clearList"
msgstr "clearList"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removes all items."
msgstr "Briše sve stavke iz liste."

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "removeListItem(int index)"
msgstr "removeListItem(int index)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removes the item at the specified index."
msgstr "Briše stavku na specificiranom indeksu."

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "item(int index)"
msgstr "item(int index)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Returns the text of the item at the specified index."
msgstr "Vraća tekst stavke na specificiranom indeksu."

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "setCurrentListItem(int index)"
msgstr "setCurrentListItem(int index)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set the current (or selected) item to the index specified. Applies to "
"ListBox and ComboBox widgets."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja trenutnu (ili označenu) stavku na specificirani indeks. "
"Primjenjivo je na ListBox i ComboBox dodatke."

#. Tag: title
#: dcop.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "&DCOP; for CheckBox and RadioButton Widgets"
msgstr "&DCOP; za CheckBox i RadioButton Dodatke"

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "setChecked(QString widgetName, bool checked)"
msgstr "setChecked(QString widgetName, bool checked)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "Checks/unchecks CheckBox or RadioButton widgets."
msgstr "Označava/sklanja oznaku sa CheckBox ili RadioButton dodataka."

#. Tag: title
#: dcop.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid "&DCOP; for TabWidget Widgets"
msgstr "&DCOP; za TabWidget Dodatke"

#. Tag: term
#: dcop.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "setCurrentTab(QString widgetName, int index)"
msgstr "setCurrentTab(QString widgetName, int index)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selected the tab by index for TabWidgets. Index starts at 0."
msgstr "Označi tab po indeksu za TabWidgets. Indeksi počinju od 0."
